{
  "name": "butterfly",
  "_about": "A butterfly -- the red admiral (Vanessa atalanta), 6 cm across the wings, the body 2 cm: velvet black-brown wings, an oblique scarlet band across each forewing and white spots at its tip, a scarlet border round the hindwing dotted black with a blue spot at its corner; the underside of the hindwing a marbled bark. Basking with its wings spread flat. A brush-foot: it stands on four legs, the first pair shrunk to hairy brushes held against its chest. Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/winged/butterflies.py on insectlib.py + wlib.py (each wing one sheet, its upperside's painting laid on it as thin sheets in layers -- the 2D butterflies' own paintings, assets/butterflies/; the wings beat in the variant \"flying\").",
